l\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mio</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A star waitress at a maid caf\u00e9. With her adorable appearance and sweet voice, Mio draws attention wherever she goes. Despite her popularity at work, she\u2019s mentally drained by the unwanted advances from creepy otaku customers. Forced to smile and tolerate their vulgar jokes and lecherous stares, she often seeks a peaceful oasis after her exhausting shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/264e14272ae4f6162552ff4d5ca36387.avif?t=1754665088\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kasumi</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rookie university lecturer who returned to Japan after graduating from a prestigious overseas institution. A beautiful half-Japanese woman with Western heritage, she has a strong maternal presence and is very popular among students. However, her lack of awareness often leads to blurred boundaries with male students, resulting in unwanted fantasies. Still, she insists they are just innocent and kind hearted kids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/dd5cc36068475e88dfc676d88f26df04.avif?t=1754665088\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sanae</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newlywed housewife. Her husband, a successful entrepreneur, is frequently away on business trips. Though she lives in luxury, she finds life dull and meaningless. She enjoys going to the bathhouse to chat with other married women. Due to her attractive appearance, she\u2019s often approached by men. Her dissatisfaction is obvious, she fantasizes daily about being dominated by men yet she struggles with guilt, believing she must remain pure as a married woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/fd3e326d27d59f7fb7fcc6e0c3adf770.avif?t=1754665088\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ayako</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A police officer. On the job, she is strict and professional, showing no mercy to criminals. However, deep down, she harbors a hidden curiosity toward forbidden desires and taboo experiences. Highly disciplined, she takes great pride in her role as a public servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/bf9b56aca34abb73cd2be51b802a31b1.avif?t=1754665088\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miki</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sex worker with a stunning figure and striking curves, always dressed in fashionable and eye catching outfits. She is cheerful, gentle, and excels at social interaction. Her irresistible charm easily disarms others, allowing her to quickly sense what her clients need and deliver the experiences they crave. Despite her profession, she has a kind heart and often helps those in need behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/5191babc65660844cfa7454286bc42c0.avif?t=1754665088\" width=400 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 animated CG scenes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b71cebdf868ec26111f12de00278f264.poster.avif?t=1754665088\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b71cebdf868ec26111f12de00278f264.webm?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b71cebdf868ec26111f12de00278f264.mp4?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/0905e1d0e470af3ec63148ee7412d4df.poster.avif?t=1754665088\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/0905e1d0e470af3ec63148ee7412d4df.webm?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/0905e1d0e470af3ec63148ee7412d4df.mp4?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 H-interaction scenes across various locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/d922b79eca6f27be7545bd10fa2888a3.poster.avif?t=1754665088\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/d922b79eca6f27be7545bd10fa2888a3.webm?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/d922b79eca6f27be7545bd10fa2888a3.mp4?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b0c9a4f33775b5209104e48b00405812.poster.avif?t=1754665088\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b0c9a4f33775b5209104e48b00405812.webm?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/b0c9a4f33775b5209104e48b00405812.mp4?t=1754665088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of mini-games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/652ec1bee4ed98eecc403e457578f957.avif?t=1754665088\" width=1920 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/833a103ac58b41f4041593eb7cbe181d.avif?t=1754665088\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734630/extras/3c18ffd9457d1a338c27bb21472e14ab.avif?t=1754665088\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
